{"id":"f3ec13b072ed757d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-tukey.md","title":"Tukey Reduction via Cofinal Maps","display":"thm-tukey — Tukey Reduction via Cofinal Maps","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-tukey","aliases":["58-thm-tukey"],"display":"thm-tukey — Tukey Reduction via Cofinal Maps","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-tukey.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-tukey"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-tukey</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tukey — Tukey Reduction via Cofinal Maps"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"70f427bb4b24622b\" href=\"?note=70f427bb4b24622b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-tukey.md\">../batch02/58-df-tukey.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c9b9175a5a31065e\" href=\"?note=c9b9175a5a31065e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,\\leq_A,\\leq_B\\in V\">\\(A,B,\\leq_A,\\leq_B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\leq_T\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is the Tukey preorder from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"70f427bb4b24622b\" href=\"?note=70f427bb4b24622b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-tukey.md\">../batch02/58-df-tukey.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(A,\\leq_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S(B,\\leq_B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\Bigl[\nA\\leq_TB\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,B,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{82pt}{}\\land\n\\forall C\\subseteq B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,B,\\leq_B)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(f[C],A,\\leq_A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(A,\\leq_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S(B,\\leq_B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\Bigl[\nA\\leq_TB\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,B,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{82pt}{}\\land\n\\forall C\\subseteq B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,B,\\leq_B)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(f[C],A,\\leq_A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This cofinal-map direction is equivalent, for directed sets, to the unbounded-map definition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> used by the upstream Tukey atom.</li>\n<li>Merely requiring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[B]\">\\(f[B]\\)</span> to be cofinal in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is too weak: a Tukey quotient must send every cofinal subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> to a cofinal subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-tukey.md","status":"resolved","id":"70f427bb4b24622b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-tukey.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9b9175a5a31065e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-tukey.md","status":"resolved","id":"70f427bb4b24622b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_T\\subseteq V^2$ is the Tukey preorder from [[../batch02/58-df-tukey.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,\\leq_A,\\leq_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(A,\\leq_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S(B,\\leq_B)\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\Bigl[\nA\\leq_TB\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,B,A)\\\\\n&\\hspace{82pt}{}\\land\n\\forall C\\subseteq B\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,B,\\leq_B)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(f[C],A,\\leq_A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"f[B]","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1406,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4468","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-tukey.md|58-thm-tukey]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["70f427bb4b24622b","e61c089fc5e610a6","c9b9175a5a31065e","36d7463d215be751"]}